# Google OAuth Configuration
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=YOUR_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID_HERE

# To get your Google Client ID:
# 1. Go to Google Cloud Console (https://console.cloud.google.com/)
# 2. Create a new project or select existing one
# 3. Enable Google+ API and Google OAuth2 API
# 4. Create OAuth 2.0 Client ID for "Web application"
# 5. Add your development URL (e.g., http://localhost:3000) to authorized origins
# 6. Add http://localhost:3000/login to authorized redirect URIs
# 7. Copy the Client ID and paste it above
